<h3 local-id=3D"3459da8761a5" id=3D"SonicautoDevelopmentGuide-1.1.2Howtocre=
ateaproject">1.1.2&nbsp;&nbsp; How to create a project</h3>
<p local-id=3D"c14a01f89232">Create an empty project folder in your own PC,=
 such as ("D:\vueproject"), then use terminal (win+R, =E2=80=98cmd=E2=80=99=
) cd into the project. &nbsp;Use commands:</p>
<p local-id=3D"9da66c8d36f5">Step1: =E2=80=98npm init=E2=80=99, this step w=
ill create =E2=80=98package.json=E2=80=99</p>
<p local-id=3D"a17210a05996">Step2: =E2=80=98npm install webpack -g=E2=80=
=99 (global install), this step can skip if you have already installed webp=
ack</p>
<p local-id=3D"2154fcdd7a2d">Step3: =E2=80=98npm install webpack-cli =E2=80=
=93save-dev=E2=80=99</p>
<p local-id=3D"1e589a45faf3">Our project will creare config.js automaticall=
y after finishing above steps. And you can run the project by using command=
 : =E2=80=98npm run dev=E2=80=99.</p>
<p local-id=3D"bcda463d5883"><br></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"0c18e9e36a30" id=3D"SonicautoDevelopmentGuide-1.1.3Developm=
entconfiguration">1.1.3&nbsp;&nbsp; Development configuration</h3>
<p local-id=3D"9dd6814199c6">Make sure you have the newest codes, use git b=
ranch to check your current branch(develop). We have to configure our npm r=
egistry to =E2=80=98<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"http://10.206.24.210=
" rel=3D"nofollow">http://10.206.24.210</a>=E2=80=99, then use command =E2=
=80=98npm install=E2=80=99, &nbsp;our cloned project will generate =E2=80=
=98node_modules=E2=80=99 automatically.</p>
<p local-id=3D"16397c120873">Set dev api=E2=80=99s url in =E2=80=98config/d=
ev.env.js=E2=80=99 as :</p>
<p local-id=3D"acb2226c5d4a">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; BASE_API =
=3D =E2=80=98<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"http://10.6.1.125/api" rel=
=3D"nofollow">http://10.6.1.125/api</a>=E2=80=99</p>
<p local-id=3D"0ba950c80183">Then use command: =E2=80=98npm run dev=E2=80=
=99, click the following link to debug locally at 0.0.0.0:8080(default, can=
 be changed in =E2=80=98/config/index.js=E2=80=99:</p>
<p local-id=3D"db2ee202cebc">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; module.ex=
port =3D { =E2=80=A6 host : =E2=80=98x.x.x.x=E2=80=99 , port =E2=80=98xxx=
=E2=80=99 =E2=80=A6}). Use =E2=80=98F12=E2=80=99 to capture the network, th=
e api will be =E2=80=9910.6.1.125/api/xxx=E2=80=99.</p>
<p local-id=3D"f1abb60b7d0b">If project runs failed, you can check log in c=
urrent terminal.</p>
<p local-id=3D"62cc8f692fb7"><br></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"0900ff6b792d" id=3D"SonicautoDevelopmentGuide-1.1.4Director=
ydescription">1.1.4&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Directory description</h3>
<p local-id=3D"af74cece2aee">Sonicauto3.0 front-end is based on VUE, we use=
 vuex to store static data, &nbsp;and use vue-router to map routes to indiv=
idual components and render each component to the correct place.</p>
<p local-id=3D"8de1eb0d95c3"><br></p>
<ul local-id=3D"cbe3bfa4dbb7">
<li local-id=3D"541cf1f08840">
<p local-id=3D"8b9c635a7708">Vuex</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"e94ba1de14dc">Usage in project: (=E2=80=98/src/core/core.sto=
re.ts=E2=80=99):</p>
<p local-id=3D"e2a31c555e56">Example:</p>
<p local-id=3D"15cf376c283e">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; In case o=
f remember current login user, we use vuex to store username, we do followi=
ng steps in our project:</p>
<p local-id=3D"cac9bebd99b8"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"e97db31f69c7">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; We can us=
e the stored data in other modules by code:</p>
<p local-id=3D"b36c081e94d6">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; const user =3D store.getters.getUsername &=
nbsp;// user =3D login username (eg: jxia)</p>
<p local-id=3D"089556c4b05a"><br></p>
<ul local-id=3D"df5037598776">
<li local-id=3D"c4c81d088169">
<p local-id=3D"b563bf757d65">Vue-router</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"542f90976ab2">Definition : &nbsp;Vue-Router is the official =
router plugin for Vue.js. It is deeply integrated with Vue.js and is suitab=
le for building single-page applications. Vue=E2=80=99s single-page app is =
based on routing and components, which are used to set access paths and map=
 them to components. The traditional app uses href to achieve page swiching=
. In the vue-router single-page app, it is the switching between paths, tha=
t means switching of components. The essence of the routing module is to es=
tablish the mapping relationship between the URL and the page. &nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"91ba67211d41"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"4309f785a915">Usage in Sonicauto3.0:</p>
<p local-id=3D"67315b33199f">Step1: create files ---- xxx.route,ts, index.t=
s</p>
<p local-id=3D"985c305ffc72">Take =E2=80=98fast-launch=E2=80=99 for example=
, first, we should export the component to vue-router, then add dependencie=
s in =E2=80=98router/index.ts=E2=80=99,</p>
<p local-id=3D"5a66f8f5d850"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"403289c2b43d"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"bd8a59e523cf">Step2: in step 1, we only add path to router, =
but the browser doesn=E2=80=99t render it. We must add a navigation bar to =
direct us to the corresponding URL path before we can continue debugging ou=
r newly created app. Adding a navigation bar to the mapping in sonicauto3.0=
=E2=80=99s process is detailed in 2.1.6. If you want to know more about Vue=
 &amp; Webpack, you should &nbsp;learn them on the official website.</p>
<p local-id=3D"8c6438bcd50e"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"0a7aea3aef90">There are commanded website for learning front=
-end:</p>
<p local-id=3D"1270707abe6e">ES6: <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https:=
//es6.ruanyifeng.com/#docs/intro" rel=3D"nofollow">https://es6.ruanyifeng.c=
om/#docs/intro</a></p>
<p local-id=3D"3de97b3205fc">JS: <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https:/=
/wangdoc.com/javascript/basic/introduction.html" rel=3D"nofollow">https://w=
angdoc.com/javascript/basic/introduction.html</a></p>
<p local-id=3D"ce621a6a1e5f">Vue: <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https:=
//v3.vuejs.org/guide/installation.html#release-notes" rel=3D"nofollow">http=
s://v3.vuejs.org/guide/installation.html#release-notes</a></p>
<p local-id=3D"c9d37b24fe39"><br></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"96e3f3fdb28c" id=3D"SonicautoDevelopmentGuide-1.1.5Namingco=
nventions">1.1.5&nbsp;&nbsp; Naming conventions</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"3751dfb6dbe7">
<li local-id=3D"5f05f0529ded">
<p local-id=3D"185d200dde60">Project name</p>
<ul local-id=3D"af41655e50f8">
<li local-id=3D"9ff353c0d899">
<p local-id=3D"91bdee13c199">0 (do not modify)</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"0089055736d4">
<p local-id=3D"4a9cb333a2f9">Modules name</p>
<ul local-id=3D"4c7a402554e5">
<li local-id=3D"7fdacf032583">
<p local-id=3D"cc0abdbda51c">Depend on =E2=80=98navId=E2=80=99</p>
<ul local-id=3D"2c989541fc30">
<li local-id=3D"2a7a5a7fde3e">
<p local-id=3D"4c94533fba71">Dashboard -&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; auto=
-dashboard</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b5edf48e440e">
<p local-id=3D"457e971f9f77">Launch &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -&=
nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; auto-launch-form-xxx</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"248fb3aafa3b">
<p local-id=3D"3ed3e73cbfe5">Trouble shooting - auto-edit-failures</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"59d73b2ce725">
<p local-id=3D"e9e93140a5a0">Monitor - auto-monitor-xxx</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7096e26ac3f5">
<p local-id=3D"fd9f45f4af1b">=E2=80=A6</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"d20d5e292387">
<p local-id=3D"6c520741a828">.vue structure</p>
<ul local-id=3D"ecd85e56b263">
<li local-id=3D"cd57cee6d1c8">
<p local-id=3D"5477b587e328">&lt;template&gt;=E2=80=A6&lt;/template&gt;</p>=
</li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"2427a9050f1f">&lt;style lang=3D=E2=80=99scss=E2=80=99&gt;=E2=
=80=A6&lt;/style&gt;</p>
<p local-id=3D"99922e13542c">&lt;script lang=3D=E2=80=99tsx=E2=80=99&gt;</p=
>
<p local-id=3D"c77843c452f4">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nb=
sp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; @Component({..})</p>
<p local-id=3D"e900cfddfd38">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Export default class xxx extends SwExtende=
dVue { =E2=80=A6 }</p>
<p local-id=3D"f3a656338614">&lt;/script&gt;</p>
<p local-id=3D"2e25224e688e">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Tip: put =
&lt;style&gt; before &lt;script&gt;, it will accelerate browser rendering.<=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"22bf4973ac1c"><br></p>
<ul local-id=3D"0d093232fbf4">
<li local-id=3D"ab2d5a6a5a04">
<p local-id=3D"da4f088a3258">Variable</p>
<ul local-id=3D"715d665fc579">
<li local-id=3D"f99301e9d8cb">
<p local-id=3D"d686e29d87ef">Use .ts instead of .js, based on ES6.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"5b6790f85205">Using =E2=80=98let=E2=80=99 instead of =E2=80=
=98var=E2=80=99, but only can be used in current code block, by using Airbn=
b config mode, if the variable in constant, or only used one time, using =
=E2=80=98const=E2=80=99 instead. &nbsp;Example:</p>
<p local-id=3D"cd63cb15bd0b">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; const a =
=3D =E2=80=98automation=E2=80=99;</p>
<p local-id=3D"93424d2d99c4">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; a =3D son=
icwall // TypeError: Assignment to constant varible</p>
<p local-id=3D"1d71730e1a90">this is because constant varible can not be mo=
dified once as it has been defined.</p>
<p local-id=3D"6a083f602967">(more details can be learned on <a class=3D"ex=
ternal-link" href=3D"http://es6.ruanyifeng.com" rel=3D"nofollow">http://es6=
.ruanyifeng.com</a>)</p>
<p local-id=3D"c37fe6833ebf"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"45c21635af58">To define a global varible, there are some exa=
mples: (codes from auto-launch-form-sonic-fast)</p>
<p local-id=3D"197fe78387e1">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; product: =
string =3D =E2=80=98=E2=80=99</p>
<p local-id=3D"4927e984c53e">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; optionTyp=
es: any[] =3D [];</p>
<p local-id=3D"6f10e092739a">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; scope: nu=
mber =3D 0;</p>
<ul local-id=3D"7130f5e5c590">
<li local-id=3D"68f74abc3da2">
<p local-id=3D"fb99aeef0232">Function name</p>
<ul local-id=3D"db64dc13daf8">
<li local-id=3D"13e8b662c8c6">
<p local-id=3D"8cd0538316f0">Hump naming our function, such as:</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"16950b792d09">updateType()=E3=80=81 getProductPlatform()=E2=
=80=A6</p>
<ul local-id=3D"91ab1204116f">
<li local-id=3D"b55c62408d6a">
<p local-id=3D"0f542bf8c9bc">Router name</p>
<ul local-id=3D"8126525ca241">
<li local-id=3D"81d731c3b4e6">
<p local-id=3D"2fb06f8a0383">Capital letter, end with =E2=80=98Route=E2=80=
=99 : =E2=80=98AutoLaunchFormSonicFastRoute=E2=80=99</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"5320193de551"><br></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"93110635911e" id=3D"SonicautoDevelopmentGuide-1.1.6Howtodis=
playanewpageinourproject">1.1.6&nbsp;&nbsp; How to display a new page in ou=
r project</h3>
<p local-id=3D"a69fe5b49420">Since that our project has already been create=
d, how can we add a new page and display it? I will take =E2=80=98Fast Laun=
ch=E2=80=99 for an example.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"47fdd263ccb3">
<li local-id=3D"4ea4919b4033">
<p local-id=3D"aa978986fe50">Step1 : create new folder at =E2=80=98/src/mod=
ules=E2=80=99, it must contain 3 files</p>
<ul local-id=3D"6c49d7b17a6a">
<li local-id=3D"64904f94d815">
<p local-id=3D"70696755559c">route.ts=E3=80=81xxx.vue(vue app)=E3=80=81inde=
x.ts</p>
<ul local-id=3D"8af7cb7f1b6f">
<li local-id=3D"96b0de4e496e">
<p local-id=3D"b75e6f0eaf73">We expose route to vue-router in index.ts &amp=
;&amp; xxx.route.ts</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cbda7f5f9e7e">
<p local-id=3D"b41a4366de36">Coding style, scripts in xxx.vue</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"028d95ef3e7a">
<p local-id=3D"c3409e549b37">Create =E2=80=98component=E2=80=99 file to add=
 child pages. And file should be named =E2=80=98xxx.vue=E2=80=99</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"f8570950ad04"><br></p>
<ul local-id=3D"b04a493cb39f">
<li local-id=3D"e3f2b2f76e7e">
<p local-id=3D"724172706c67">Step2 : add new route in =E2=80=98/router/inde=
x.ts=E2=80=99</p>
<ul local-id=3D"2575d01afaf3">
<li local-id=3D"e0827c93d616">
<p local-id=3D"8ac818366539">Code: import { =E2=80=A6 } from =E2=80=98@/mod=
ules/xxx(folder name)=E2=80=99</p>
<ul local-id=3D"ae7c7f2cf93c">
<li local-id=3D"9228b5a8bb43">
<p local-id=3D"30055b1b3442">Each page has an annotation -&gt; =E2=80=98//L=
aunch=E2=80=99, add your route in relative position</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f77a3a88dfaf">
<p local-id=3D"c3ff05c58138">Then add Route=E2=80=99s component in VueRoute=
r(also in this file)</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"6780ce7d70dc"><br></p>
<ul local-id=3D"62046f9f5237">
<li local-id=3D"7bc60847ef08">
<p local-id=3D"81ebcdc93436">Step3 : add child nav in =E2=80=98shared/nav-s=
ervice/nav.data.ts=E2=80=99</p>
<ul local-id=3D"f3fd5948c492">
<li local-id=3D"948ed4ef3e77">
<p local-id=3D"e0f7fc0668cd">Finde corresponding parent catalog, add param<=
/p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"cc3a008c7935">{&nbsp; navId: =E2=80=98xxx=E2=80=99, //functi=
on name</p>
<p local-id=3D"6f87f6c7838d">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Icon: =E2=80=98xxx=E2=80=99=
, //sonicwall=E2=80=99s icon</p>
<p local-id=3D"23b794edf3cc">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; text: =E2=80=98xxx=E2=80=99=
, //displayed in page titile</p>
<p local-id=3D"ae169c1d2fab">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; route:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nb=
sp; =E2=80=98/xxx/xxx=E2=80=99, //&nbsp; /main function/app=E2=80=99s funct=
ion</p>
<p local-id=3D"3774fb1c794c">},</p>
<ul local-id=3D"dd1e07f4558a">
<li local-id=3D"3a55ed291c4f">
<p local-id=3D"b1fcbfa9728a">After all these steps, run command in terminal=
: =E2=80=98npm run dev=E2=80=99, your project will run in local PC, 0.0.0.0=
:8080(can be changed in /config/index.js).</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"1bc0e75b3c24"><br></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"44404b97ace2" id=3D"SonicautoDevelopmentGuide-1.1.7APIinter=
action------Axios">1.1.7&nbsp;&nbsp; API interaction ------ Axios</h3>
<p local-id=3D"67f36ddbc0d8">Axios: Promise based HTTP client for the brows=
er and node.js</p>
<ul local-id=3D"1ac73bd4b429">
<li local-id=3D"c66bcf86ab18">
<p local-id=3D"ea107ec7dc38">Features:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"fb14d163dd72">
<li local-id=3D"8e743805b728">
<p local-id=3D"77907e5403ff">Make XMLHttpRequests from the browser</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5b820f0b8496">
<p local-id=3D"c4c59417c14e">Make http requests from node.js</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"24d4570a694e">
<p local-id=3D"0d0a14091a54">Supports the Promise API</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4753e337d5a2">
<p local-id=3D"2aabcd394ba6">Intercept request and response</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d7210bdf1686">
<p local-id=3D"ea5c9acc413e">Transform request and response data</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"22177610681a">
<p local-id=3D"9166cf76b504">Cancel requests</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"de3544523575">
<p local-id=3D"8a3730d953d4">Automatic transforms for JSON data</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"64e5b57ae0ea">
<p local-id=3D"ba5e010aa0b0">Client side support for protecting against XSR=
F</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"51e074cb1a90"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"03c62eda3d62">In Sonicauto3.0, we definite axios as =3D&gt;<=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"34a7115dc5b7">//&nbsp; create and axios instance</p>
<p local-id=3D"277405dfaa6b">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"9fd9289d9be0"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"2981e208db02">&nbsp;&nbsp;//&nbsp; request interceptor</p>
<p local-id=3D"ed5f327b1292">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"0128eab957ac"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"b0a23d014ec3">&nbsp;&nbsp;//&nbsp; response interceptor</p>
<p local-id=3D"5a908ad62bf8">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"f31cfe660754"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"222d1132e814">Usage examples:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"05bd8e774577">
<li local-id=3D"407a343aa4df">
<p local-id=3D"a984dd8dae75">POST:</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"fe2aa320c07b">apiService.post(=E2=80=98api=E2=80=99, {params=
}).then(=E2=80=A6).catch(=E2=80=A6)</p>
<ul local-id=3D"e1269aa61a58">
<li local-id=3D"016292fab49b">
<p local-id=3D"a2ca25f19772">GET:</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"924a8dfd3493">apiService.get(=E2=80=98api=E2=80=99)</p>
<p local-id=3D"eeb09a537f7a"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"407351502987">Details can be found more at: <a class=3D"exte=
rnal-link" href=3D"http://axios-js.com/docs/index.index.html" rel=3D"nofoll=
ow">axios-js.com/docs/index.index.html</a></p>
<p local-id=3D"30e0bc755d15"><br></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"8116a0ebebbd" id=3D"SonicautoDevelopmentGuide-1.1.8Tipsford=
eveloping(front-end)">1.1.8&nbsp;&nbsp; Tips for developing(front-end)</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"a133cff80849">
<li local-id=3D"467004780f44">
<p local-id=3D"6679cc0675a5">Debug on local PC.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"5e05cea1fd76">
<li local-id=3D"cc74e6427656">
<p local-id=3D"8d165dba5518">After debugging, test with backend on nginx se=
rver.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"a85f1b576b52">
<p local-id=3D"f03be47a8066">Communicate with backend about param in API.</=
p>
<ul local-id=3D"eb58440d635d">
<li local-id=3D"9371c6c21ee9">
<p local-id=3D"750b0fdfc9a9">Before starting a new app, communicate with ba=
ckend. Make sure the method, needed params and the function of API.</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"4051b4bd07b5">
<p local-id=3D"b3b6d4b50f31">In order to have a smoothy UE(user experience)=
, data should be as simple as possible.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e7c0b2971618">
<p local-id=3D"107268b0a45f">If we want any alert messages, we can ask back=
end to response us in resp.data.message or using status code.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"c79fed13686d">
<p local-id=3D"839171f09f8e">If function has only one selection(such as sel=
ect gen_number), in order to add further feature, we can definite our globa=
l variable as an Array.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"643a3e2b33e1"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"e9754d4dc524"><br></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"a53797fabd13" id=3D"SonicautoDevelopmentGuide-1.2Setupdevel=
opmentenvironmentonfrontendserver">1.2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Setup development =
environment on frontend server</h2>
<p local-id=3D"0018034f7e5a">Our production frontend server uses CentOS 7 a=
nd Nignx to support Vue.js. The domain name is <a class=3D"external-link" h=
ref=3D"http://sonicauto3.eng.sonicwall.com" rel=3D"nofollow"><strong>sonica=
uto3.eng.sonicwall.com</strong></a> and the IP address is <strong>10.203.15=
.24/24</strong>. If you want to change any of them, please send an email to=
 Gavin(cliu@<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"http://SonicWALL.com" rel=3D=
"nofollow">SonicWALL.com</a>) for permission. Local development server can =
assign any value.</p>
<p local-id=3D"2b752fa34f92"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"5bb4558e1328">If you want to have a development server, plea=
se ask Jane(<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"mailto:yaji@sonicwall.com" r=
el=3D"nofollow">yaji@sonicwall.com</a>) to create a new virtual PC, then us=
ing Nginx to redirect api to =E2=80=9910.6.1.125=E2=80=99(declared in 2.1.8=
). Now we have 2 dev server, 10.6.0.177(William=E2=80=99s), and 10.6.0.196(=
Garry=E2=80=99s).</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"8c7082536e2b" id=3D"SonicautoDevelopmentGuide-1.2.1PrepareC=
entOS7">1.2.1&nbsp;&nbsp; Prepare CentOS 7</h3>
<p local-id=3D"eb965299a257">The production server has 4 cores CPU, 8G memo=
ry and 200G hard disk. The development server can choose similar configurat=
ion but not as powerful as the production one.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"b35226129230" id=3D"SonicautoDevelopmentGuide-1.2.2AboutFir=
ewall">1.2.2&nbsp;&nbsp; About Firewall</h3>
<p local-id=3D"3aa9176d512e">Check the Status of Firewalld</p>
<p local-id=3D"1ae427753a14">[root@sonicauto1 ~]# systemctl status firewall=
d</p>
<p local-id=3D"897e49add3cf"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"897c844fe312">Stop Firewalld</p>
<p local-id=3D"88f27cdff68b">[root@sonicauto1 ~]# systemctl stop firewalld<=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"b784beb0b5e6"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"184c1b2055a5">Disable Firewalld</p>
<p local-id=3D"c69ced6a2e07">[root@sonicauto1 ~]# systemctl disable firewal=
ld</p>
<p local-id=3D"ae0cef091d39"><br></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"703b7a669ca5" id=3D"SonicautoDevelopmentGuide-1.2.3DisableS=
ELinux">1.2.3&nbsp;&nbsp; Disable SELinux</h3>
<p local-id=3D"c7703fb8deab">SELinux (Security Enhanced Linux) is a Linux k=
ernel security module that allows administrators and users more control ove=
r access controls. It allows access based on SELinux policy rules. The serv=
er needs to disable&nbsp; SELinux.</p>
<p local-id=3D"9c371ab57f37"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"31167740e574">To permanently disable SELinux on your CentOS =
7 system, follow the steps below:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"ce00ecfbddcb">
<li local-id=3D"0b480e2c8db6">
<p local-id=3D"145af2dd4abb">Open the /etc/selinux/config file and set the =
SELINUX mod to disabled:</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"93338aaefccd">/etc/selinux/config</p>
<p local-id=3D"8bcc49f60708"># This file controls the state of SELinux on t=
he system.</p>
<p local-id=3D"9b2f3a462610"># SELINUX=3D can take one of these three value=
s:</p>
<p local-id=3D"bff437ecb52a">#&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; enforcin=
g - SELinux security policy is enforced.</p>
<p local-id=3D"0797217e95d5">#&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; permissi=
ve - SELinux prints warnings instead of enforcing.</p>
<p local-id=3D"49215b03eda7">#&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; disabled=
 - No SELinux policy is loaded.</p>
<p local-id=3D"c87a7dee3e03">SELINUX=3Ddisabled</p>
<p local-id=3D"a31e038ac613"># SELINUXTYPE=3D can take one of these two val=
ues:</p>
<p local-id=3D"731f443e6dfe">#&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; targeted=
 - Targeted processes are protected,</p>
<p local-id=3D"566c8da75431">#&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; mls - Mu=
lti Level Security protection.</p>
<p local-id=3D"320176b3047a">SELINUXTYPE=3Dtargeted</p>
<p local-id=3D"ad3044ab5eab"><br></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"24765f4fd05a">
<li local-id=3D"8ba60e47bb00">
<p local-id=3D"ab47d4f5c353">Save the file and reboot your CentOS system wi=
th:</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"7c7c35f4a0b8">[root@sonicauto1 ~]# shutdown -r now</p>
<p local-id=3D"60fef4cd3b4b"><br></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"71bc9133980b">
<li local-id=3D"c494dbfecb09">
<p local-id=3D"fa0c706f5ce6">Once the system boots up, verify the change wi=
th the sestatus command:</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"84f9a69f83e0">[root@sonicauto1 ~]# sestatus&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"ad0dc5d1e1bf">The output should look like this:</p>
<p local-id=3D"baaccd1eafbb">SELinux status:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&=
nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; disabled<=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"baf05ef800ce"><br></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"e035a5880013" id=3D"SonicautoDevelopmentGuide-1.2.4WhyNginx=
">1.2.4&nbsp;&nbsp; Why Nginx</h3>
<p local-id=3D"75688994847f">NGINX is a free, open-source, high-performance=
 HTTP server and reverse proxy, as well as an IMAP/POP3 proxy server. NGINX=
 is known for its high performance, stability, rich feature set, simple con=
figuration, and low resource consumption.</p>
<p local-id=3D"cb0d6a92d667"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"55cff7948314">NGINX is one of a handful of servers written t=
o address the <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"http://www.kegel.com/c10k.=
html" rel=3D"nofollow">C10K problem</a>. Unlike traditional servers, NGINX =
doesn=E2=80=99t rely on threads to handle requests. Instead it uses a much =
more scalable event-driven (asynchronous) architecture. This architecture u=
ses small, but more importantly, predictable amounts of memory under load. =
Even if you don=E2=80=99t expect to handle thousands of simultaneous reques=
ts, you can still benefit from NGINX=E2=80=99s high-performance and small m=
emory footprint. NGINX scales in all directions: from the smallest VPS all =
the way up to large clusters of servers.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"62f9357263f0" id=3D"SonicautoDevelopmentGuide-1.2.5Howtoins=
tallNginx">1.2.5&nbsp;&nbsp; How to install Nginx</h3>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"80ea9dd1a2ce">
<li local-id=3D"dd874b58826f">
<p local-id=3D"079c6ab653bb">Go to Nginx official web site to find the late=
st stable version.</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"cb579ba00bff">In <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"http://n=
ginx.org/en/download.html" rel=3D"nofollow">http://nginx.org/en/download.ht=
ml</a>, the current stable version is 1.16.1</p>
<p local-id=3D"56ea97f0a973"><br></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"1ce63c0e0ec2">
<li local-id=3D"508bf50c8df5">
<p local-id=3D"d18eb9e17a68">Download</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"f7df675cf347">[root@sonicauto1 ~]# wget <a class=3D"external=
-link" href=3D"http://nginx.org/download/nginx-1.16.1.tar.gz" rel=3D"nofoll=
ow">http://nginx.org/download/nginx-1.16.1.tar.gz</a></p>
<p local-id=3D"d74d12e2c172"><br></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"bcd9225bfdaa">
<li local-id=3D"dbe146a431b4">
<p local-id=3D"a496f770d063">Unzip and install</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"a340a8c78aff">[root@sonicauto1 ~]# tar zxvf nginx-1.16.1.tar=
.gz[root@sonicauto1 ~]# cd nginx-1.16.1[root@sonicauto1 ~]# ./configure --w=
ith-http_ssl_module[root@sonicauto1 ~]# make[root@sonicauto1 ~]# make insta=
ll</p>
<p local-id=3D"8ba85be2425e"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"73e0d588be8c">CentOS may raise some error messages, then use=
r needs to install some dependency libraries firstly.</p>
<p local-id=3D"318e7ba1d3cb">[root@sonicauto1 ~]# yum -y install openssl op=
enssl-devel</p>
<p local-id=3D"62b252de73ba"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"fc9d4387d9a6">After that, user can install Nginx successfull=
y.</p>
<p local-id=3D"26111904ee31"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"1015167eb21a">The default configurations are as follows:</p>
<p local-id=3D"7e2dbc446de0">Configuration summary</p>
<p local-id=3D"767e2309368f">&nbsp; + using system PCRE library</p>
<p local-id=3D"e5b5f0981f51">&nbsp; + using system OpenSSL library</p>
<p local-id=3D"c863e7ed5b57">&nbsp; + using system zlib library</p>
<p local-id=3D"e7d30da02aac"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"f8ddc6154773">&nbsp; nginx path prefix: "/usr/local/nginx"</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"b39f1a42ef0a">&nbsp; nginx binary file: "/usr/local/nginx/sb=
in/nginx"</p>
<p local-id=3D"65d0d0d0442f">&nbsp; nginx modules path: "/usr/local/nginx/m=
odules"</p>
<p local-id=3D"f9146d8f7370">&nbsp; nginx configuration prefix: "/usr/local=
/nginx/conf"</p>
<p local-id=3D"94afec1d7bfc">&nbsp; nginx configuration file: "/usr/local/n=
ginx/conf/nginx.conf"</p>
<p local-id=3D"2043ed4fff33">&nbsp; nginx pid file: "/usr/local/nginx/logs/=
nginx.pid"</p>
<p local-id=3D"efbece852094">&nbsp; nginx error log file: "/usr/local/nginx=
/logs/error.log"</p>
<p local-id=3D"98d477130213">&nbsp; nginx http access log file: "/usr/local=
/nginx/logs/access.log"</p>
<p local-id=3D"d78b8b073c51">&nbsp; nginx http client request body temporar=
y files: "client_body_temp"</p>
<p local-id=3D"4be919ae137c">&nbsp;&nbsp;nginx http proxy temporary files: =
"proxy_temp"</p>
<p local-id=3D"90ccdb6a0a4b">&nbsp; nginx http fastcgi temporary files: "fa=
stcgi_temp"</p>
<p local-id=3D"3c6e09d8fa13">&nbsp; nginx http uwsgi temporary files: "uwsg=
i_temp"</p>
<p local-id=3D"67910796bfd1">&nbsp; nginx http scgi temporary files: "scgi_=
temp"</p>
<p local-id=3D"1bb3a3e40310"><br></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"876b694a4b94" id=3D"SonicautoDevelopmentGuide-1.2.6Configur=
eNginx(develop)">1.2.6&nbsp;&nbsp; Configure Nginx(develop)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"9efa1103982f">First of all, you should add nginx to PATH ( v=
im /etc/source to export PATH)</p>
<ul local-id=3D"3d913675e02e">
<li local-id=3D"8f421bcec596">
<p local-id=3D"e9e7af48f574">Directory structure :</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"6f7d51b86e69">We only focus on =E2=80=98conf=E2=80=99 &amp;&=
amp; =E2=80=98html=E2=80=99 in front-end</p>
<ul local-id=3D"894587a545c1">
<li local-id=3D"f4d164547f5c">
<p local-id=3D"50ca09764c56">Configuration</p>
<ul local-id=3D"5f246acbaac2">
<li local-id=3D"47d0c2f5f236">
<p local-id=3D"421726ab8815">/conf/nginx.conf,</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"e5679cdd370d">user&nbsp; root;</p>
<p local-id=3D"d09a54ed434c">worker_processes&nbsp; auto;</p>
<p local-id=3D"560aeeccef4e"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"03a4a7159b16">error_log&nbsp; /var/log/nginx/error.log debug=
; &nbsp;// logs</p>
<p local-id=3D"b7abbab7a5d3"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"64bcd2c7418a">pid&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; =
/var/run/nginx.pid;</p>
<p local-id=3D"86d3d71b288d"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"897b7d5ec7bd">events {</p>
<p local-id=3D"0c6cd62c22d9">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; worker_connections&nbsp; 10=
24;&nbsp;&nbsp; // max connections</p>
<p local-id=3D"7b3ff5a5d2f1">}</p>
<p local-id=3D"006428ff72c2"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"6356dce22c18"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"97a469c210ed">http {</p>
<p local-id=3D"75a4eaa9e6bf">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; include&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&n=
bsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; mime.types;</p>
<p local-id=3D"1bb8867d3ec7">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; default_type&nbsp; applicat=
ion/octet-stream;</p>
<p local-id=3D"65871d56b8f1"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"1ec7b3aaef4a">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; log_format&nbsp; main&nbsp;=
 '$remote_addr - $remote_user [$time_local] "$request" '</p>
<p local-id=3D"90d811e09c0d">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;=
&nbsp;'$status $body_bytes_sent "$http_referer" '</p>
<p local-id=3D"98f26736c9b1">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&=
nbsp; '"$http_user_agent" "$http_x_forwarded_for"';</p>
<p local-id=3D"903b230d511c">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; sendfile&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&=
nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; on;</p>
<p local-id=3D"1977394e240c">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"9ce50f1b9894">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; keepalive_timeout&nbsp; 65;=
&nbsp; // keep sessions alive</p>
<p local-id=3D"06f628693fac"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"c314908ce664">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; server {</p>
<p local-id=3D"db4da5e3908d">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; lis=
ten&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 80;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&n=
bsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; // 80 =E2=80=93 http;</p>
<p local-id=3D"4c5900a693c8">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ser=
ver_name&nbsp; 10.6.0.196;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; // local PC=E2=80=99s ip addre=
ss</p>
<p local-id=3D"8a7ad384730e">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; cli=
ent_max_body_size 2048m;</p>
<p local-id=3D"1c3800507d1d">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; loc=
ation / {</p>
<p local-id=3D"3f49d7ad8057">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; index&nbsp; index.html index.htm;</p>
<p local-id=3D"0550a2c9d2b2">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nb=
sp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; // redirect js&amp;css files</p>
<p local-id=3D"65287315114d">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; }</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"585ce38cebd8">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; loc=
ation ~ /api/ {</p>
<p local-id=3D"fd9929ba81da">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <strong>proxy_pass </strong><a class=3D"external-link"=
 href=3D"http://10.6.1.125" rel=3D"nofollow"><strong>http://10.6.1.125</str=
ong></a>;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; // redirect api u=
rl</p>
<p local-id=3D"d36ca08b8205">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; proxy_read_timeout 3600s;</p>
<p local-id=3D"99a0361f2f70">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; proxy_ignore_client_abort&nbsp; on;</p>
<p local-id=3D"27d3d5fc7d6b">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; }</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"4bb586764c10">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; }</p>
<p local-id=3D"f5d445d6993b">}</p>
<p local-id=3D"19bdd2f90076"><br></p>
<ul local-id=3D"d759aeb5b55c">
<li local-id=3D"c5806b059b33">
<p local-id=3D"523892a500a1">Html</p>
<ul local-id=3D"659f62932708">
<li local-id=3D"761be2ca1b0e">
<p local-id=3D"4c8f549869e2">/nginx/html</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"c81e91b0e9ff">These files will be generated automatically by=
 webpack. In our project, using command: =E2=80=98npm run build=E2=80=99, w=
ebpack will generate a folder named =E2=80=98dist=E2=80=99, it integrates a=
ll of our components. We only need to copy the folders/files from =E2=80=98=
dist=E2=80=99 to =E2=80=98/nginx/html=E2=80=99.</p>
<p local-id=3D"398393696c2d"><br></p>
<ul local-id=3D"e15c85f37790">
<li local-id=3D"7b961393b88e">
<p local-id=3D"9000e3528a41">Remember to reload nginx every time we update =
codes.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"9521e3b481cc">
<li local-id=3D"afd1574ba1b5">
<p local-id=3D"30c2dd4b5985">Using command: =E2=80=98nginx -s reload=E2=80=
=99</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ddfe58693df9">
<p local-id=3D"eb3b7fac8b2e">Refresh our browser</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"1f23dd1e7404"><br></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"00d3f16a34ba" id=3D"SonicautoDevelopmentGuide-1.2.7Configur=
ateNginx(production)">1.2.7&nbsp;&nbsp; Configurate Nginx(production)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"bf213696ae33">Edit the existing conf file:</p>
<p local-id=3D"17472b5000ea">[root@sonicauto1 ~]# vi /usr/local/nginx/conf/=
nginx.conf</p>
<p local-id=3D"d0320a9da9a0"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"c6272417c7ac">Here is a copy of current production server=E2=
=80=99s configuration file. System administrator can use this file to enabl=
e Nginx server work smoothly. It is straight forward.</p>
<p local-id=3D"2f7072cff25e"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"39aa598e2290">user&nbsp; root;</p>
<p local-id=3D"302265a3a6c5">worker_processes&nbsp; auto;</p>
<p local-id=3D"58b1c4de1d4f"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"1636d8f84490">error_log&nbsp; /var/log/nginx/error.log debug=
;</p>
<p local-id=3D"f6cac70034c3">pid&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; =
/var/run/nginx.pid;</p>
<p local-id=3D"f12aff980db6"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"80b3c5f07b33">events {</p>
<p local-id=3D"a50344e55b6a">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; worker_connections &nbsp;10=
24;</p>
<p local-id=3D"82825bee8282">}</p>
<p local-id=3D"ef9487eebcf6"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"4b2f3961d3dd">http {</p>
<p local-id=3D"c7428b99503e">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; include&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&n=
bsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; mime.types;</p>
<p local-id=3D"6ae0d2fc02e7">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;default_type&nbsp; applicat=
ion/octet-stream;</p>
<p local-id=3D"89f990fd5c46"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"b7733943700d">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; log_format&nbsp; main&nbsp;=
 '$remote_addr - $remote_user [$time_local] "$request" '</p>
<p local-id=3D"e3c0b1757eea">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&=
nbsp; '$status $body_bytes_sent "$http_referer" '</p>
<p local-id=3D"4e2d0b66a89e">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;=
&nbsp;'"$http_user_agent" "$http_x_forwarded_for"'</p>
<p local-id=3D"5874a097965d">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nb=
sp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;=
&nbsp;' - $request_time $upstream_response_time';</p>
<p local-id=3D"399f02f67dea"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"67e4887263f5">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; access_log&nbsp; /var/log/n=
ginx/access.log&nbsp; main;</p>
<p local-id=3D"39de409a7545"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"8b29f1eec919">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; sendfile&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&=
nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; on;</p>
<p local-id=3D"bf683571d8da"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"7ab2000025ec">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; keepalive_timeout &nbsp;65;=
</p>
<p local-id=3D"c7d08aa13a8b"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"f02a8e2c72b6">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; server {</p>
<p local-id=3D"beda8e5738bc">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; lis=
ten 80;</p>
<p local-id=3D"eca2e8b30b00">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;ser=
ver_name <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"http://sonicauto3.eng.sonicwall=
.com" rel=3D"nofollow">sonicauto3.eng.sonicwall.com</a>;</p>
<p local-id=3D"7545b73731d4">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;ret=
urn 301 https://$server_name$request_uri;</p>
<p local-id=3D"434e9f4903d2">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; }</p>
<p local-id=3D"6d180426f0d1"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"84d438313149">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; server {</p>
<p local-id=3D"f8ce91f2e953">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; lis=
ten&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 443 ssl;</p>
<p local-id=3D"c2906c419db1">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ser=
ver_name&nbsp; <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"http://sonicauto3.eng.son=
icwall.com" rel=3D"nofollow">sonicauto3.eng.sonicwall.com</a>;</p>
<p local-id=3D"37b084a98dcb"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"faca6369105d">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ssl=
_protocols&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;TLSv1 TLSv1.1 TLSv1.2;</p>
<p local-id=3D"5c177c5df649">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;ssl=
_ciphers&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; AES128-SHA:AES256-=
SHA:RC4-SHA:DES-CBC3-SHA:RC4-MD5;</p>
<p local-id=3D"fcfcaffeaf81">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ssl=
_certificate&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; /usr/local/nginx/conf/server_2020.crt;=
</p>
<p local-id=3D"75f7e1c48213">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ssl=
_certificate_key /usr/local/nginx/conf/server_2020.key;</p>
<p local-id=3D"337659fa8e59">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ssl=
_session_cache&nbsp;&nbsp; shared:SSL:10m;</p>
<p local-id=3D"d1c8d6d205da">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ssl=
_session_timeout 8h;</p>
<p local-id=3D"11a3b1d96a12"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"37f51191665f">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ind=
ex index.html;</p>
<p local-id=3D"5a6c46c9054f">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; cli=
ent_max_body_size 1024M;</p>
<p local-id=3D"fdfc91cdb1b9"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"1ba6fa9f2f8c">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; loc=
ation / {</p>
<p local-id=3D"8d162193b82f">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html;</p>
<p local-id=3D"39bf22cf2a49">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; }</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"a691b8fbe596"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"6c0ad4492192">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; loc=
ation ^~ /api/ {</p>
<p local-id=3D"b388a353ea70">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; proxy_pass <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"http://1=
0.203.15.25" rel=3D"nofollow">http://10.203.15.25</a>;</p>
<p local-id=3D"a8a02ea64d48">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; proxy_read_timeout 3600s;</p>
<p local-id=3D"ed3b1f3e814f">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; proxy_ignore_client_abort&nbsp; on;</p>
<p local-id=3D"6be88a87d856">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; }</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"f64f3d4e5085"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"f5742bf2e3cf">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; err=
or_page&nbsp;&nbsp; 500 502 503 504&nbsp; /50x.html;</p>
<p local-id=3D"c50dda02bf73">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; loc=
ation =3D /50x.html {</p>
<p local-id=3D"b5649977416d">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; root&nbsp;&nbsp; html;</p>
<p local-id=3D"1d120951f892">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; }</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"2c4598050fba">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; }</p>
<p local-id=3D"62b795d0fcd5">}</p>
<p local-id=3D"7ce712f3f50b"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"aa575d4f547c"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"4685ddd5e7af">access_log are in /var/log/nginx/access.log</p=
>
<p local-id=3D"3431bd810177">error_log are in /var/log/nginx/error.log</p>
<p local-id=3D"5d6ddae26170">Nginx makes HTTP requests redirect to HTTPS</p=
>
<p local-id=3D"d455635bc218"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"9317fbb28ef7">Go to <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"http:=
//nginx.org/en/docs/" rel=3D"nofollow">http://nginx.org/en/docs/</a> for ho=
w to configurate every parameters.</p>
<p local-id=3D"12536932b690"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"21f2a17b8d45">After editing configuration file, check syntax=
.</p>
<p local-id=3D"e1e3d3a0f700">[root@sonicauto1 ~]# /usr/local/nginx/sbin/ngi=
nx -tnginx: the configuration file /usr/local/nginx/conf/nginx.conf syntax =
is oknginx: configuration file /usr/local/nginx/conf/nginx.conf test is suc=
cessful</p>
<p local-id=3D"8e6fa942018d"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"753fe9783866">If everything is ok, restart Nginx to enable n=
ew configurations.</p>
<p local-id=3D"1906cb2a1fef">[root@sonicauto1 ~]# /usr/local/nginx/sbin/ngi=
nx =E2=80=93s reload</p>
<p local-id=3D"094e7f093ce5"><br></p>
