ce-anchor-link" id=3D"_Toc56156383"></span></span>Initial setup</h3>
<p local-id=3D"c3924ac4c941">Once Django has been installed, use following =
two commands to auto-generate some code that establishes a Django project =
=E2=80=93 a collection of settings for an instance of Django, including dat=
abase configuration, Django-specific options and application-specific setti=
ngs.</p>
<p>[root@sonicauto3-backend django]# django-admin startproject sonicauto</p=
>
<p local-id=3D"13fd40ef753a"><br></p>
<p>[root@sonicauto3-backend django]# cd sonicauto</p>
<p local-id=3D"058a32e8274a"><br></p>
<p>[root@sonicauto3-backend sonicauto]# django-admin startapp api_v1</p>
<p local-id=3D"1db24d2ca792"><br>
Let's look at what&nbsp;'<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://docs.dj=
angoproject.com/en/2.2/ref/django-admin/#django-admin-startproject" rel=3D"=
nofollow">startproject</a>'&nbsp;and 'startapp' created: <br><span class=3D=
"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img cla=
ss=3D"confluence-embedded-image" height=3D"188" width=3D"196" loading=3D"la=
zy" src=3D"4ea529730789225c2d0b83528a2233fe53785b3c8409f098a9ab67ebb6f0d6b8=
" data-image-src=3D"https://sonicwall.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachmen=
ts/2274492531/worddav4e5ed7102c2a1b1aa7dd111e0607fa2e.png?version=3D1&amp;m=
odificationDate=3D1775532001498&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-unr=
esolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"2274492753" data-lin=
ked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-li=
nked-resource-default-alias=3D"worddav4e5ed7102c2a1b1aa7dd111e0607fa2e.png"=
