e-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"227449253=
1" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"1" data-media-id=3D"6aaa0396-8=
03c-4876-a95c-e6d0767b2f07" data-media-type=3D"file"></span> <br>
This means we create a project named 'sonicauto' and create an application =
named 'api-v1' and Django automatically generates the basic directory struc=
ture for them. <br>
For detailed description of each file, please access <a class=3D"external-l=
ink" href=3D"https://docs.djangoproject.com/en/2.2/intro/tutorial01/" rel=
