"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"_Toc56156384"></span></span>Two main functio=
ns in backend</h3>
<p local-id=3D"6170aa9ffccc">The Django framework of Sonicauto is constitut=
ed of classes and configuration files which cater to two main functional ar=
eas of the backend server application, VIZ:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"afa67ad0fc10">
<li local-id=3D"bb3c482dbd36">
<p local-id=3D"f584a194c76b">DB Access function</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a30fa4b22b70">
<p local-id=3D"40955e90136a">System Access function</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"b302d9c5d354"><br>
Two .py files under 'api_v1' correspond to each of these functions:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"7f77353da0ff">
<li local-id=3D"f457a79c3180">
<p local-id=3D"5a3d4f659b2b">sonicautoDBAccess.py</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"750b25ff015f">
<p local-id=3D"6ac0913a903a">sonicautoSystemAccess.py</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"e70494947de8"><br></p>
<h4 local-id=3D"bf71d119e65c" id=3D"SonicautoDevelopmentGuide-_Toc535939771=
_Toc12017866_Toc15890334_Toc17104836DBAccessfunction"><span class=3D"conflu=
ence-anchor-link" id=3D"SonicautoDevelopmentGuide-_Toc535939771"><span clas=
s=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"_Toc535939771"></span></span><span class=
=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"SonicautoDevelopmentGuide-_Toc12017866"><=
span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"_Toc12017866"></span></span><sp=
an class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"SonicautoDevelopmentGuide-_Toc158=
