<h4 local-id=3D"9595e7056fca" id=3D"SonicautoDevelopmentGuide-GenericViews"=
>Generic Views</h4>
<p local-id=3D"38081d66f5f5">One of the key benefits of class-based views i=
s the way they allow you to compose bits of reusable behavior. REST framewo=
rk takes advantage of this by providing a number of pre-built views that pr=
ovide for commonly used patterns. <br>
In our project, we define our own generic views by inheriting generics.Gene=
ricAPIView and overriding some default functions. <br><br><br><br><br><br><=
br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br>
