<td data-local-id=3D"3467b05a741a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3367a0fdac93">0: get data successfully <br>
1: get data failed or signature has expired or permission denied</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"00260de25e17">
<td data-local-id=3D"080a5333df00" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dd9e3e9d0ef6">Instruction</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"79a675206825" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"d53253415ca2">
<li local-id=3D"6fc425c25bff">
<p local-id=3D"c22051772e59">Need authentication, must put token in the Aut=
horization header using the TOKEN schema like <br><br>
Authorization: TOKEN &lt;token&gt;</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d11dc0b68035">
<p local-id=3D"3c13d1f5732e">Only admin user can access</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"af3a3d604d61">
<p local-id=3D"08966ef83507">Different error response <br><br>
{ <br>
"status": 1, <br>
"message": "column scmabel does not exist " <br>
} <br><br>
{ <br>
"detail": "Signature has expired." <br>
} <br><br>
{ <br>
"detail": "You do not have permission to perform this action." <br>
}</p></li>
</ol></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
