<h4 local-id=3D"bbb6b7febd7e" id=3D"SonicautoDevelopmentGuide-GenerateAPIDo=
cwithrest_framework_swagger">Generate API Doc with rest_framework_swagger</=
h4>
<p local-id=3D"e22a5f3f69ae">In Developing an application, we'll write our =
required API's. To Document these API's we use Django Rest Swagger. <br>
Django Rest Swagger is used to provide Documentation for all API's which ar=
e used in your application with brief description about each API individual=
ly. <br>
First we need to install the swagger.</p>
<p>[root@sonicauto3-backend sonicauto]# pip3 install django-rest-swagger</p=
>
<p local-id=3D"3839c675dff6"><br>
Add "rest_framework_swagger" to Django settings INSTALLED_APPS. <br>
