<p local-id=3D"40bf3b77a844"><span data-colorid=3D"i7fugdklw9">python3]#</s=
pan> <span data-colorid=3D"yxpa54mzvz">wget </span><a class=3D"external-lin=
k" href=3D"https://www.python.org/ftp/python/3.6.6/Python-3.6.6.tar.xz" rel=
=3D"nofollow"><span data-colorid=3D"tqimv7ihhj">https://www.python.org/ftp/=
