<p local-id=3D"e02b1bc412e9"><span data-colorid=3D"xq3qs7zx00">python3]#</s=
pan> <span data-colorid=3D"hzbv5tgrcs">tar -xvJf Python-3.6.6.tar.xz</span>=
</p>
