eering_Public</span> <br>
Edit file /etc/fstab, add the following mount point:</p>
<p>[root@sonicauto3-backend sonicauto]# cat /etc/fstab</p>
<p local-id=3D"b4cb4a667ce3"><br><span data-colorid=3D"dm16765qfy">#</span>=
<br><span data-colorid=3D"tn3jnf5uw7"># /etc/fstab</span><br><span data-col=
