confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"_Toc56156401"></span></span>Use iptables to o=
pen port</h3>
<p local-id=3D"8a4f9f4ed3c1">Here we use iptables instead of firewall to op=
en port 80. <br><br><span data-colorid=3D"dp574n8u19"># stop firewall and d=
isable it</span></p>
<p>[root@sonicauto3-backend</p>
<p local-id=3D"f636a9678a5e"><span data-colorid=3D"gfxc7b7ipy">~]#</span> <=
span data-colorid=3D"zukp4braz6">systemctl stop firewalld.service</span></p=
>
<p>[root@sonicauto3-backend</p>
<p local-id=3D"57583801a854"><span data-colorid=3D"c2kn94w0ov">~]#</span> <=
span data-colorid=3D"mk4w7hm7h9">systemctl disable firewalld.service</span>=
 <br><span data-colorid=3D"vx28ebiawr"># install iptables-services</span></=
p>
<p>[root@sonicauto3-backend</p>
<p local-id=3D"cbfc428ab287"><span data-colorid=3D"a9mu6o23cv">~]#</span> <=
span data-colorid=3D"juj2q3okdy">yum install iptables-services</span> <br><=
span data-colorid=3D"lw52zkzsip"># edit configure file</span></p>
<p>[root@sonicauto3-backend ~]#</p>
<p local-id=3D"48de55813ef7"><span data-colorid=3D"bi163c25ai">vim /etc/sys=
config/iptables</span> <br><span data-colorid=3D"hinuf4lgm9"># sample confi=
guration for iptables service</span><br><span data-colorid=3D"gzdu1ux70f">#=
 you can edit this manually or use system-config-firewall</span><br><span d=
ata-colorid=3D"jetp4jd6bg"># please do not ask us to add additional ports/s=
ervices to this default configuration</span><br><span data-colorid=3D"o1i2u=
lw69f">*filter</span></p>
<p>:INPUT ACCEPT [0:0]</p>
<p local-id=3D"7acf4fab87ea"><br></p>
<p>:FORWARD ACCEPT [0:0]</p>
<p local-id=3D"63d24256b672"><br></p>
<p>:OUTPUT ACCEPT [0:0]</p>
<p local-id=3D"84b0200c06f7"><br><span data-colorid=3D"aa9bqak9uk">-A INPUT=
 -m state --state RELATED,ESTABLISHED -j ACCEPT</span><br><span data-colori=
d=3D"ouszoef3uf">-A INPUT -p icmp -j ACCEPT</span><br><span data-colorid=3D=
"ymq51isds7">-A INPUT -i lo -j ACCEPT</span><br><span data-colorid=3D"r4gdg=
iyuj5">-A INPUT -p tcp -m state --state NEW -m tcp --dport 22 -j ACCEPT</sp=
an><br><span data-colorid=3D"nasv1xgg62">-A INPUT -p tcp -m state --state N=
EW -m tcp --dport 80 -j ACCEPT</span><br><span data-colorid=3D"di3wqmtajy">=
-A INPUT -p tcp -m state --state NEW -m tcp --dport 8080 -j ACCEPT</span><b=
r><span data-colorid=3D"rei7e20ffh">-A INPUT -p tcp -m state --state NEW -m=
 tcp --dport 8000 -j ACCEPT</span><br><span data-colorid=3D"ejohrgzyvr">-A =
INPUT -p tcp -m state --state NEW -m tcp --dport 443 -j ACCEPT</span><br><s=
pan data-colorid=3D"t5klx5i9or">-A INPUT -p tcp -m state --state NEW -m tcp=
 --dport 1717 -j ACCEPT</span><br><span data-colorid=3D"wg4cwz70wn">-A INPU=
T -j REJECT --reject-with icmp-host-prohibited</span><br><span data-colorid=
=3D"ktgooelqx3">-A FORWARD -j REJECT --reject-with icmp-host-prohibited</sp=
an><br><span data-colorid=3D"ri7wfkh9ew">COMMIT</span> <br><span data-color=
id=3D"p1b7jnmao5"># enable the configure</span></p>
<p>[root@sonicauto3-backend ~]#</p>
<p local-id=3D"284fb1882d92"><span data-colorid=3D"nv9o9x0lzm">systemctl re=
start iptables.service</span></p>
<p>[root@sonicauto3-backend ~]#</p>
<p local-id=3D"4e7c4c999bd7"><span data-colorid=3D"flp5cljcma">systemctl en=
able iptables.service</span></p>
