ce-anchor-link" id=3D"_Toc56156406"></span></span>Deploy SonicCore-Vault</h=
2>
<p local-id=3D"3c88cbef628e">SonicCore-Vault is used to parse .swi build fi=
le to get scmlabel. It is developed by Tim Liu, we deploy SonicCore-Vault a=
ccording to the doc he provided. <br>
//depot/SQA/SWIFT4.0/SONICAUTO3.0/deploy-soniccore-vault.txt <br>
Once done, try command like below to verify.</p>
<p>[root@sonicauto-dev yliu]# swi-info /tmp/firmware/sgao-1591068851257_son=
icwall_nsv_vmware_7.0.0.0-60v-42-U38-905-395bb7b9.0.swi</p>
<p local-id=3D"260fe7f1db4c"><br><span data-colorid=3D"fhw341e018">{Name:so=
nicwall.com/soniccore/sonicos Version:7.0.0.0-60v-42-U38-905-395bb7b9 Platf=
orm:vmware}</span></p>
<p local-id=3D"ec21f60435ca"><br></p>
