<p local-id=3D"4893bad0e872"><br><span data-colorid=3D"en50vrdrc9">chdir =
=3D /opt/django/sonicauto</span><br><span data-colorid=3D"pt5wjuta41">#path=
 of wsgi.py file</span><br><span data-colorid=3D"y3puffze67">module =3D son=
