confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"_Toc56156412"></span></span>Configure Nginx</=
h2>
<p local-id=3D"791149ac9a9c">Create a dictionary named "staticdir" at same =
level with manage.py, then add STATIC_ROOT to settings.py. <br><span data-c=
olorid=3D"htar3rn0rh">STATIC_ROOT =3D os.path.join(BASE_DIR, "staticdir/")<=
/span> <br>
Use following command to collect static file.</p>
<p>[root@sonicauto3-backend sonicauto]#</p>
<p local-id=3D"ec9c6cece72c"><span data-colorid=3D"ct4xd85pz3">python3 mana=
ge.py collectstatic</span> <br>
Edit file '/usr/local/nginx/conf/nginx.conf' like below. <br><span data-col=
orid=3D"x2hxo4fktg">worker_processes 4; # same number of CPUs</span> <br><s=
pan data-colorid=3D"fprcrkd202">events {</span><br><span data-colorid=3D"o6=
c6udu17e">worker_connections 1024;</span><br><span data-colorid=3D"s3bti2wi=
p9">}</span> <br><br><span data-colorid=3D"f1qa84m2vy">http {</span><br><sp=
an data-colorid=3D"ffr25fuyp1">include mime.types;</span><br><span data-col=
orid=3D"vqpqux49yg">default_type application/octet-stream;</span></p>
<p>log_format main '$remote_addr - $remote_user [$time_local] "$request" '<=
/p>
