<p local-id=3D"bac0e79c74a9">Our production frontend server uses CentOS 7 a=
nd Nignx to support Vue.js. The domain name is <strong>sonicauto3.eng.sonic=
wall.com</strong> and the IP address is <strong>10.203.15.24/24</strong>. I=
f you want to change any of them, please send an email to Gavin(cliu@SonicW=
ALL.com) for permission. Local development server can assign any value.</p>
