ce-anchor-link" id=3D"_Toc56156416"></span></span>About Firewall</h3>
<p local-id=3D"61f21600abc7">Check the Status of Firewalld</p>
<p>[root@sonicauto1 ~]# systemctl status firewalld</p>
<p local-id=3D"90197656f2dc"><br>
Stop Firewalld</p>
<p>[root@sonicauto1 ~]# systemctl stop firewalld</p>
<p local-id=3D"49c535fba670"><br>
Disable Firewalld</p>
<p>[root@sonicauto1 ~]# systemctl disable firewalld</p>
