nce-anchor-link" id=3D"_Toc56156420"></span></span>How to install Nginx</h3=
>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"2cae0d7311c8">
<li local-id=3D"01e4b91984c6">
<p local-id=3D"43823492c225">Go to Nginx official web site to find the late=
st stable version.</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"d1b469c540d5">In <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"http://n=
ginx.org/en/download.html" rel=3D"nofollow">http://nginx.org/en/download.ht=
ml</a>, the current stable version is 1.16.1<br><span class=3D"confluence-e=
mbedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"conflue=
nce-embedded-image" height=3D"264" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"a1=
cc55f77abf8bc45974703b08dee145aed1a358ca27a9a2d020fcfe57fd3420" data-image-=
src=3D"https://sonicwall.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/2274492531=
/worddavaef7924624757568b04b7fc63aec3c02.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDa=
