e=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"2274492531" data-linke=
d-resource-container-version=3D"1" data-media-id=3D"62df947c-93a1-403e-b89c=
-0f3fa14de3df" data-media-type=3D"file"></span></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"c14616648fbf">
<li local-id=3D"935e9afd6a81">
<p local-id=3D"71b39277e768">Download</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"3236e06bc4c3"><br></p>
<p>[root@sonicauto1 ~]# wget <a href=3D"http://nginx.org/download/nginx-1.1=
6.1.tar.gz">http://nginx.org/download/nginx-1.16.1.tar.gz</a></p>
<p local-id=3D"a3e2ce3b2c3e"><br></p>
<p local-id=3D"16d4f03a0201"><br></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"62db62dbb4ae">
<li local-id=3D"278015e41200">
<p local-id=3D"d03a35aeb6c4">Unzip and install</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"ff726830c6b4"><br></p>
<p>[root@sonicauto1 ~]# tar zxvf nginx-1.16.1.tar.gz</p>
<p local-id=3D"43249283cc29"><br></p>
<p>[root@sonicauto1 ~]# cd nginx-1.16.1</p>
<p local-id=3D"8220540b565f"><br></p>
<p>[root@sonicauto1 ~]#</p>
<p local-id=3D"cd3ac30adbd6"><span data-colorid=3D"pg741qum78">./configure =
--with-http_ssl_module</span></p>
<p>[root@sonicauto1 ~]# make</p>
<p local-id=3D"de0402f1e028"><br></p>
<p>[root@sonicauto1 ~]# make install</p>
<p local-id=3D"263dfe762ddc"><br>
CentOS may raise some error messages, then user needs to install some depen=
dency libraries firstly.</p>
<p>[root@sonicauto1 ~]#</p>
<p local-id=3D"0e1b07d08b76"><span data-colorid=3D"qyuiugt4ng">yum -y insta=
ll openssl openssl-devel</span> <br>
After that, user can install Nginx successfully. <br>
The default configurations are as follows:<br><span data-colorid=3D"a2787v6=
9l9">Configuration summary</span><br><span data-colorid=3D"zml26ighon">+ us=
ing system PCRE library</span><br><span data-colorid=3D"etscs1ay4n">+ using=
 system OpenSSL library</span><br><span data-colorid=3D"bpb0pm6woe">+ using=
 system zlib library</span> <br><span data-colorid=3D"ydynszhdk6">nginx pat=
h prefix: "/usr/local/nginx"</span><br><span data-colorid=3D"eef2y97dq7">ng=
inx binary file: "/usr/local/nginx/sbin/nginx"</span><br><span data-colorid=
=3D"dw6ltfm0gf">nginx modules path: "/usr/local/nginx/modules"</span><br><s=
pan data-colorid=3D"jou0uo9ka7">nginx configuration prefix: "/usr/local/ngi=
nx/conf"</span><br><span data-colorid=3D"bc1wp3rmq8">nginx configuration fi=
le: "/usr/local/nginx/conf/nginx.conf"</span><br><span data-colorid=3D"zozn=
ytz0ay">nginx pid file: "/usr/local/nginx/logs/nginx.pid"</span><br><span d=
ata-colorid=3D"bvr34lh4rf">nginx error log file: "/usr/local/nginx/logs/err=
or.log"</span><br><span data-colorid=3D"z7gdiiiusa">nginx http access log f=
ile: "/usr/local/nginx/logs/access.log"</span><br><span data-colorid=3D"cu1=
bnxsrz0">nginx http client request body temporary files: "client_body_temp"=
