ce-anchor-link" id=3D"_Toc56156421"></span></span>Configurate Nginx</h2>
<p local-id=3D"651295c283c8">Edit the existing conf file:</p>
<p>[root@sonicauto1 ~]# vi /usr/local/nginx/conf/nginx.conf</p>
<p local-id=3D"5a028e4b766c"><br>
Here is a copy of current production server's configuration file. System ad=
ministrator can use this file to enable Nginx server work smoothly. It is s=
traight forward. <br><span data-colorid=3D"dk322t6h55">user root;</span><br=
><span data-colorid=3D"yf2rad8yxr">worker_processes auto;</span> <br><span =
data-colorid=3D"ds45ua8p9m">error_log /var/log/nginx/error.log debug;</span=
><br><span data-colorid=3D"if8uwtfbx5">pid /var/run/nginx.pid;</span> <br><=
span data-colorid=3D"vfpakuyj3a">events {</span><br><span data-colorid=3D"m=
beba3skgq">worker_connections 1024;</span><br><span data-colorid=3D"ymuwpmv=
oah">}</span> <br><span data-colorid=3D"t2fy8zcnyk">http {</span><br><span =
data-colorid=3D"pigj6bj10a">include mime.types;</span><br><span data-colori=
d=3D"rjugi0j5x9">default_type application/octet-stream;</span></p>
<p>log_format main '$remote_addr - $remote_user [$time_local] "$request" '<=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"76bb317a3e0a"><br><span data-colorid=3D"oxz0ow6i2a">'$status=
 $body_bytes_sent "$http_referer" '</span><br><span data-colorid=3D"gqayjv2=
shf">'"$http_user_agent" "$http_x_forwarded_for"'</span><br><span data-colo=
rid=3D"y7k2odpccq">' - $request_time $upstream_response_time';</span> <br><=
span data-colorid=3D"au6v23fsrk">access_log /var/log/nginx/access.log main;=
</span> <br><span data-colorid=3D"fzti84ol4v">sendfile on;</span> <br><span=
 data-colorid=3D"hav5ebq0lv">keepalive_timeout 65;</span> <br><span data-co=
lorid=3D"qg7oh2ggz5">server {</span><br><span data-colorid=3D"la78yt5wd5">l=
isten 80;</span><br><span data-colorid=3D"cstswrc6ub">server_name sonicauto=
3.eng.sonicwall.com;</span><br><span data-colorid=3D"ryuj97qjrm">return 301=
