<span data-colorid=3D"vzf8749rmo">ssl_ciphers AES128-SHA:AES256-SHA:RC4-SHA=
:DES-CBC3-SHA:RC4-MD5;</span><br><span data-colorid=3D"kwnrpzp8u6">ssl_cert=
ificate /usr/local/nginx/conf/server_2020.crt;</span><br><span data-colorid=
