27"></span></span>Generate requirements.txt</h3>
<p local-id=3D"8109fe3ff9f4"><br></p>
<p>[root@sonicauto3-backend sonicauto_back_docker]#</p>
<p local-id=3D"c693a28cf110"><span data-colorid=3D"ol77449i7x">pip3 freeze =
